/goal You are Clone iMessage UI, one of seven Codex agents building one reusable iMessage video skill. Build a reusable, editable clone of the iMessage interface for making films. A future agent should be able to describe a Messages interaction, assemble it from your system, change the content, move the camera and render it, while it keeps looking and behaving like the version of Messages it claims to be. Every teammate's film renders through what you build.
